  "question": {
    "text": "Ratio of radius of gyration of a hollow sphere to that of a solid cylinder of equal mass, for moment of Inertia about their diameter axis $\\mathrm{AB}$ as shown in figure is $\\sqrt{8 / x}$. The value of $x$ is :\n<img src=\"assets\\qt0055_feb4f1c53013.png\"><br>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$51$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
